Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna stay home again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I still feel a little yucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I faked being sick to skip school...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Have been for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to face Miyamura after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be so easy\Nto just text him, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hang tomorrow,\Nbut I'm free the day after!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you should come over then!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.91,0:02:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I Can't Say It Out Loud"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I Can't Say It Out Loud"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"I Can't Say It Out Loud"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How're you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How're you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot better, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Can I have some yogurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I saw my bro this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? How'd he look?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He was walking with a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:03:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, which one do you want to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This orange one has gummy balls in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have that; I don't like citrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Back up, a girl?! Who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who? I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She was wearing some other uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some other uniform {\i0}equals {\i1}some high-school girl{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And {\i1}hanging out with her {\i0}times\N{\i1}I'm in love with you {\i0}equals {\i1}he's cheating?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he cheating on me?\NHe's totally cheating on me, isn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"CHEATING!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he cheating on me?\NHe's totally cheating on me, isn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"CHEATING!"\N"CHEATING!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he cheating on me?\NHe's totally cheating on me, isn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"CHEATING!!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he cheating on me?\NHe's totally cheating on me, isn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he cheating on me?\NHe's totally cheating on me, isn't he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making too many assumptions.\NThey're probably just friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they look like friends?\NWhat were they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She was practically wrapped around his arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't make a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl? Wrapped around his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is stupid. I should just text\Nhim to see what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She could be a friend from\Nmiddle school, like Shindo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not have even been...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.25,0:04:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Third Year Elective: Modern Japanese, Class A"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hori! Your cold all cleared up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet! Keep your voice down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here. He was real worried about you, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sitting over by the window.\NYou should go sit--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.87,0:04:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, please find a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hori-san's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see her in homeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She was here for first period,\Nbut she was, like, really on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Like in a really foul mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost seems like she doesn't wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys get into a fight or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Well, okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go to the other classroom, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk to you--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I gotta head home early today! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The other day, you were awake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it because I knew\Nyou were awake, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's--what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:06:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-The girl you were walking with. Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.12,0:06:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--Say you have no idea.\NSay that Souta had the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Uhh...\N--Say you have no idea.\NSay that Souta had the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it was just his imagination.\NSay it's not like that, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Chika-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh, she goes to Yasaka--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've {\i1}never {\i0}heard you\Ncall a girl by her first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And {\i0}she was hanging off of you in public, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Chika-chan's smart\Nif she's going to Yasaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san? You've got it all wrong!\NChika-chan and I aren't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Shindo! Chika-chan is Shindo's girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan slipped and twisted her ankle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.29,0:06:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and then, so did Shindo,\Nso I lent her an arm to lean on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not like Chika-chan is--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Japanese History"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan this, Chika-chan that,\NChika-chan everything! What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, please listen, Chika...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:07:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika, Chika, Chika!\NShut {\i1}up {\i0}about Chika already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know her last name...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Kyoko Hori"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Kyoko Hori"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she's not mad about me walking with her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Kyoko Hori"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's mad about the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's mad about the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Modern Japanese History Workbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Modern Japanese History Workbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That was all it took to\Nmake her this mad at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Modern Japanese History Workbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw a book right in his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's totally lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop! Miyamura wouldn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.87,0:07:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You can have yogurt,\Nyou don't need to ask--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My bro's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Tell him I'm not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hello.\N--Tell him I'm not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I mean, I'll leave if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Modern Japanese History Workbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:07:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Modern Japanese History Workbook"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, thought about just\Ngiving it to you tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but you might need it for homework...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--He's definitely mad at me.\N--She's definitely mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she mad, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's still about Chika-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably has no idea why I'm mad at him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--S-Sorry--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm sorry!\N--S-Sorry--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry for throwing a book at you. Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay. It's my fault\Nfor bringing up Ch--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Shindo's girlfriend,\Nwhen it was making you upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Do you know Chika-chan's last name, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.91,0:09:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, I wish you'd told me sooner!\NThen I wouldn't have assumed wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I told you.\NYou just didn't listen, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. I mean, I said it because\NI knew you were awake, so yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.45,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting a response or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was kind of scared\Nto hear {\i1}how {\i0}you'd respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for dropping that on you and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamu--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.04,0:09:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.91,0:09:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Yuriko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this? Is he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pierced all over! Can I touch your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No smoking inside, Kyosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet {\i1}you {\i0}smoke cigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These piercings are sick.\NDid you do them yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, back in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, {\i1}no smoking inside{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko, big girls don't hit\Ntheir daddies with an axe kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--They sure do nowadays. Did you not hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--So he {\i1}is {\i0}her dad.\N--They sure do nowadays. Did you not hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I come home for the first time\Nforever, and Yuriko's not around,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,my own daughter is beating me up,\N{\i1}and {\i0}she brought home a random guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people would call before\Nshowing up on our doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko, I'm hungry! C'mon, feed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll groan, but make something\Nfor me anyway. She's a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry, sir, I should have intro--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I go to Kiri High. My name's Izumi Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, same school as Kyoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot! Was I interrupting something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? N-No, you weren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got long eyelashes.\NAnyone ever told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.79,0:11:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,'Scuse me, coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko... could you put it\Non the table next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have no idea where she\Ngets this from. She's so violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I wouldn't say she's violent...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an only kid, or you got siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.25,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding! Man, I {\i1}always {\i0}wanted to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kind of freaking me out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, so Hori-san calls you\Nby her first name? That's surpri--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun, you know, my name's Hori-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you call my daughter by her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course. I'll use her first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Kyo--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--C'mon, I'm just kidding!\N--Kyo--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.08,0:12:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be totally awkward switching\Nto her first name out of the blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I were anywhere else right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko! Kyoko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with you and\NMiyamura-kun? Is he your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,W--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, got a problem with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--Watch out, it's gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hori-san...\N--Watch out, it's gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like boys with long hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you looked in a mirror lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll-I'll cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:13:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut it short, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, you should just tie it back.\NWouldn't want it to go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ignore him, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko-chan, get us some bobby pins!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls must be all\Nover you, huh, Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! No, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're fine settling for Kyoko here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's the one I fell for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, man! I wish I could go back to high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are your bobby pins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exactly like Yuriko was way back when.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet {\i1}you've {\i0}been this immature\Nsince then, too, you big, fat loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:14:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! We won't have enough dinner for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyoko, Souta, me, Izumi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay, I'll go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her. I guess you could\Nborrow Miyamura's silverware.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd mine go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We have some disposable\Nchopsticks you could use...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have chopsticks, either?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about Kyosuke being super annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure? He's always so pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, him being a Hori\Nkind of justifies his behavior...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know very much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd like to learn more\Nabout you, little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, I hope I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, the feeling's mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.16,0:15:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can walk from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know how hard it is\Nto say "see you tomorrow"...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...and just how fast her heart can beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so how many problems\Ndid we have to do for Math?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid. I called {\i1}you{\i0}.\NDon't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it happen. Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.87,0:16:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.91,0:16:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,See you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.41,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one closest to her, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll get a part-time job!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.12,0:17:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Then you should work at our place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks kind of down today...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura! Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? You're spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We should head to the student council room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I said, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right! You were totally\Nlooking at something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I wasn't. Let's just\Nget to the council room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it something you need to hide from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been acting weird lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon. What was that\Ndaze you were in just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? If something's\Nbothering you, I'll listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got such big eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and a thin figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san's like that, too.\NThat's why Ishikawa-kun likes her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's pretty and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.29,0:18:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, because I'm stupid?\NYou really think I can't help you with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No, you're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cute, and I'm not, so you\Nwouldn't get what's bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being serious here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And so am I!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I were you, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my personality is hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Ayasaki always hanging around Kono?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They're like, {\i1}Beauty and the Beast{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be Beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakura's such a cute name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Beauty is my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wh-What?!\N--Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's, uh, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a guy I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I'm not cute like you, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.41,0:19:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you blush before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you're always so calm and\Nlevel-headed, but when you blush like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.83,0:20:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you look really cute, Sakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Remi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Katakiri High"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Katakiri High"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why do you need me to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Katakiri High"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Didn't you already leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.25,0:20:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Same with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he just made me come with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Hori-san! I was wondering\Nabout the English midterm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I translate that one grammar form again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.70,0:20:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You forgot again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're feeling awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, a little. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to worry about it.\NDon't make me repeat myself, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're in their own little world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:21:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell is that answer?!\NYou're worse than Iura.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hopeless at English.\NI'm only good at -ing verbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost five.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's at five?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, someone was supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Izumi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean {\i1}you{\i0}, Miyamura! C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Izumi Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.91,0:21:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Izumi Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant Souta's friend. His last name's "Izumi."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Izumi Miyamura"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I thought you were gonna\Nstart calling me by my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.95,0:21:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you want me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You know when you get all flustered,\NI'm the one who gets embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.08,0:21:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dummy Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.29,0:22:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,my name doesn't start with "Dummy."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.91,0:22:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm home--
